Q?t=1780"]},{"field":"floor","text":"Josh expects stretches of bad shooting in his return. FG% already sits near 39.5%, so the floor goes lower.","sources":["https://youtu.be/_vbAP5y182A?t=1650"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}